Subject: [PATCH] H7: OpSec / reproducible builds phase closed (two-host sha256
 gate, secret-in-git gate, 7 mutation controls)

Gate met literally: a secret committed to the tree turns CI red
(tools/check_opsec.py fail-closed over scan_secrets, wired into make
test), and two independent hosts build aura-types --release --lib to the
same sha256 (--remap-path-prefix to a shared virtual root, toolchain
pinned 1.99.1). Validator keys: keystore save 0600, loader now rejects
loose permissions, owner-only access log without secret material. CI:
least-privilege permissions blocks + toolchain pins (linted). NC 7/7.
Stage 1 (H0-H7) closed.
